  "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes a golden retriever standing on a rock under a rainbow with text that equates the commemoration of 9/11 with 'pride month' for LGBTQ+ individuals, claiming that homosexuality is a 'bigger tragedy.' This is a hateful and intentionally inflammatory message that devalues the grief and trauma associated with 9/11 by comparing it to the celebration of LGBTQ+ identity. The visual of the dog under a rainbow is used ironically to mock LGBTQ+ pride, while the text promotes a harmful and false narrative that equates LGBTQ+ identity with tragedy. The meme is designed to provoke outrage and spread misinformation, targeting the LGBTQ+ community with derogatory and offensive content.",
